Manage switchover endpoints. This API is not yet implemented on the backend; commands will fail against a live Confluent Cloud environment.

Usage:
  confluent switchover endpoint [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a switchover endpoint.
  delete      Delete one or more switchover endpoints.
  describe    Describe a switchover endpoint.
  list        List switchover endpoints.
  update      Update a switchover endpoint.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent switchover endpoint [command] --help" for more information about a command.
